# EXPECT: is not PROVABLY numeric here
# (#218) A NUMERIC module binding written a string by the interrogating
# function: the VM binds it function-local (prev 1, module 1); the pair is
# a C double, so the name leaves the class and is refused by name with the
# writer's kind as the reason.
z is 1.0
define u() as:
    z is "s"
    return prev of z
print of (u of [])
print of z
